			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Enable graceful Cocoon degradation and production safety\n\nChanges:\n1. CocoonStart now gracefully degrades when the Cocoon sidecar is unavailable, logging a warning instead of an error and returning Ok(()). The workbench functions without the extension host.\n2. EmitOTLPSpan now returns early in release builds to avoid unnecessary span emission overhead in production.\n3. PostHogCapture and OTLPFlush in bootstrap-fork.js now return early when NODE_ENV=production, preventing telemetry events from being sent in production environments.\n4. Remove eu-assets.i.posthog.com from CSP script-src since telemetry is now disabled in production.\n\nThese changes ensure the editor operates in degraded mode when Cocoon is unavailable while preventing telemetry overhead in production builds.",
			"SHA": "b0dcc091543f624bad2152e7122912e5a63e1b39"
		},
